      {
        "author_name": "Razgaming 21",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115865861696891793539/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWo5d95Fcq8IrBcxleB1GsdikHdIqoOdJIX6i3BM183Y5yBS88=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I bought a suit for my son for his prom he was not sure if he was liking it and was not sure if he want it The staff constantly  told me multiple times to buy it and just bring it back if he doesn’t end up wearing one it  they told me I had 30 days  . The following week I went to return the suit because my son chose another one . They lied to me about their policy and decided to makes excuses for not able to return my purchase . The tag was on everything was okay but they decided still to find excuses and lie about it . The staff was so disrespectful especially this guys names Maxime he was racist mocked me at a point that I had to call the police I’m really disappointed at this company and I hope nobody buys from there they scam u just to make their sales . They will force you to buy stuff .",
        "time": 1720302838,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alexandra Murray",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116641819632753322309/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU-L0qahaBaMKuNgZCm6zp22CNvOkAwcBwwkDSMCz9goYlj-h4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Rude on the phone, not helpful in person when it came to one of their blazers leaking black ink on my new blush top. One item was bought this month, the other one was bought over a year ago. Buy a lot of clothes here and So disappointed. Manager needs to brush up on her customer service skills.",
        "time": 1558882386,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "William Dobson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109966070786431786283/reviews",
        "language": "en",
