        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVbYXlwD0KfDtaE1R3ZCWtyDH0e02o80Xqgb5rj72E6O6Ih-Bkl=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Browsed for 10 to 15 minutes while 3 employees were chatting at cash. Never offered their help. Had to ask them myself, and felt like i was bothering them. They brought me to the cabins, then back to cash to chat. No follow up. See you never.",
        "time": 1669313952,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "maha sale",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105710908992759658978/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIk108x-RtoxOfHBtmSPfuD-NaaEAoEFcAXFIx5mipQaAHqkw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I bought a suite last week for a wedding, when I tried it on the suite fit perfectly. However, it was very wrinkled, I ask if they can steem it, they said yes and asked me to come back after an hour. When I went back I was told the suit was steem and wrinkle free. I was very happy, to my surprise on Sunday morning when I open the suit back, it was still wrinkled, I was stressed out, as I had to be at the groom house at 9 am, I removed the tags, tried to iron it, and steem it, but I was not able to get the wrinkles out . it\nas not a very pleasant experience, i very stressed, I am really not happy",
        "time": 1658367555,
        "translated": false
      },
